  <String key="File.Header">
    Flag Maker settings: the wind, the next flag's design, the mod. Your flags are saved with
    your city, not here.\n
    \n
    Edit it while the game runs: changes apply within a second.\n
    \n
    - Decimals use a dot: 0.5.\n
    - Percentages as the slider shows: 47 means 47%.\n
    - Colors as #RRGGBB.\n
    - Out-of-range values are pulled into range; unreadable values and unknown names are
    ignored (FlagMaker.log says which).\n
    - A missing line keeps its current value.\n
    - An unreadable file is left alone (the log says so).\n
    - The mod rewrites this file on every change: your own notes are lost.\n
    - Delete it with the game closed to reset everything.
  </String>
